The Two-million downloads celebration event in [[The Battle Cats]]. From March 10th, 2015 to March 29th, 2015.

==Event==
*'''Campaign 1: Blitz Events'''
During this event, every day will have two bonus blitz stages:

- Blitz XP from 12-1pm.

- Normal Cat Ticket chance from 6-7pm.
*'''Campaign 2: Cat Food Gift'''

During this event, everyday players can get 10 Cat Food bonus.

